  "//scale": "Global compensation: an SVG fills its box edge-to-edge, but the glyphs these icons replace floated smaller inside a padded font em-box. Without scaling down, a call site passing the old font.pixelSize as iconSize would render Material visibly larger than the classic glyph it stands in for. Tuned against the app's real clusters.",
